{"summary":"Public history for task v5-ledger-long-moderate-2 (ledger), stage 3 of 8. Entry point: engine.solve(data); deliver complete replacement contents for allowlisted engine.py and rules.py, with no third-party libraries, tools, network, or workspace access. Implement all requirements revealed so far; stage passes are provisional. 28 actions remain.

Requirements: Input has events and rounding. Each event amount starts with nonnegative integer price × quantity (default 1). Aggregate by account|currency, defaulting to default|USD; retain keys even when totals are zero. kind=refund negates the final amount; other kinds are positive charges. Current stage: apply discount_bp, clamped to [0,10000], to price×quantity; divide by 10000 and round using rounding (floor or half_up). All intermediate magnitudes are nonnegative. Refund sign is applied to the final amount.

Checkpoint artifact: engine.py groups event amounts using account/currency defaults and calls rules.amount(event, data['rounding']). rules.py currently computes price×quantity and negates for refunds, but does not yet implement discount or rounding. Public feedback: stage 1 passed 2 checks; stage 2 passed 4 checks. Current artifact is the stage-2 version; stage 3 is outstanding. Supplied trial notes are unverified."}
